# The installers are held in Git LFS. Without this file nothing tells the LFS
# client that these paths are LFS-managed, so `git clone` and `git lfs pull` leave
# the 133-byte pointers in place instead of the files - which is what broke
# SG-LPK's first build attempt, and what would happen to anyone cloning this
# repository by hand.
*.deb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.exe filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
